From: Fork Author <fork@example.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 08:08:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add Meal Queue (undated meal backlog with shopping-list
 export)

Adds a new, fully additive 'meal queue' feature as a mealie fork:
- Backend: new MealQueueItem model/table, schema, repository, and
  households/meal-queue controller. Only 4 existing files touched,
  each by a single import + registration line (household models
  __init__, repository_factory, routes/households __init__).
- Frontend: new page at /household/meal-queue, api client, composable,
  and a sidebar nav entry. Reuses the existing
  RecipeDialogAddToShoppingList component for bulk-adding uneaten
  queue recipes to a shopping list.
- No existing route, model, or schema was modified in place.
